{"availability":"available","full":"Hasan-Al-Hussein/employee-request-hub","name":"employee-request-hub","description":"Deployed Next.js and Supabase request-to-decision workflow with authentication, roles, RLS, and reviewer-ready demos.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-16T06:56:33Z","updated":"2026-07-31T11:56:01Z","branch":"master","homepage":"https://employee-request-hub.vercel.app","topics":["nextjs","postgresql","row-level-security","supabase","typescript","vercel"],"demo":"https://employee-request-hub.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:23:23.591Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T18:23:23.591Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T18:23:23.591Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T18:23:23.591Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A polished, intentionally scoped SaaS MVP for one complete employee equipment request -> approver review -> decision workflow.","Employee Request Hub is a small real product, not a mockup. Employees submit equipment requests, approvers review the queue, and employees can see the final approved/rejected status plus the approver decision note.","The assessment brief asked for one complete request -> review -> decision flow with two user types. This project deliberately avoids broad HR platform features and focuses on shipping one complete, understandable workflow:"],"features":["One request type: equipment requests.","Two roles: employee/requester and approver.","One decision model: pending, approved, rejected.","One durable record: the request plus optional decision note."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Hasan-Al-Hussein/employee-request-hub/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"000a7d4a89b448cb35c732e8e41ac190cc6215af5bb30f27e5eec2d82b56279a","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T18:23:23.762Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:23:23.762Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A polished,